### 1) Login as Anna (building 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/student-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "StudentNumber": "s098203", "password": "Pass123!" }

### 2) Anna creates an invitation (NO building header, on purpose)
# EXPECT 200
# Copy the token from request 1 into @annaToken
@annaToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..3uW7CNQQ3_xcJrgBDW9vK86RpzVHuymFCNh4h5KALkE

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/app/myinvitation/create
Content-Type: application/json
